      "Slide 1 is always the 'Title Slide' (ph0 = 'Unit N' + line break + unit topic).",
      "Slide 2 is always 'Capitolo + Immagine' = the Step 1 divider (ph14 = 'Step 1' + line break + step title; ph13 empty picture).",
      "Each STEP begins with a 'Capitolo + Immagine' divider slide; units have 2+ steps.",
      "Content concept slides are '2_Testo + 1 Immagine' (heading ph15 + body ph18 + empty picture ph16).",
      "When a concept overflows one slide it continues as '1_Testo + 1 Immagine' (caption TEXT_BOX repeats the concept name, body in ph15, picture ph16) or 'Testo + 1 Immagine' (heading ph15 + long body ph18, no picture).",
      "Diagram / mind-map slides use '3 colonne Txt + Img' and are built from free AUTO_SHAPE boxes + connector LINES rather than text placeholders.",
      "Comparison / data slides use 'Tabella' (heading ph15 + empty TABLE placeholder ph14/ph15 to be filled by hand)."
